    "sections": {
        "description": "HighNews makes it easy to build a professional news, magazine, blog, or publishing website without starting from scratch. With 50+ ready-to-import starter sites, you can quickly launch a complete website using the WordPress Block Editor, Elementor, or your preferred page builder. The theme combines flexible content layouts, customizable widgets, block patterns, engaging banner designs, light and dark modes, WooCommerce integration, RTL support, multilingual compatibility, and accessibility-friendly features to give you complete control over your site's design and content. Built for modern publishing, HighNews also integrates smoothly with popular WordPress plugins, helping you create a fast, flexible, and user-friendly website that is ready to grow with your audience. View Demo: https://demos.afthemes.com/covernews/highnews/"
    },
